# other's parent, so these are computed explicitly here and passed in
# below - still catalog-specific (built from RESULTS_DIR, same as
# everything else), just no longer inferred. Module-level, not per-
# chromosome, since every chromosome and every gene in one catalog
# legitimately shares one download of the same environmental layers.
